#: ktipwindow.cpp:32
#, fuzzy
msgid "Useful tips"
msgstr "Kandalfowe wužitne pokiwy"

#: ktipwindow.cpp:36
msgid "KTip"
msgstr "KTip"

#: ktipwindow.cpp:52
#, fuzzy
msgid "Useful Tips"
msgstr "Kandalfowe wužitne pokiwy"

#: tips.cpp:3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<P>\n"
"There's a lot of information about KDE on the\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.kde.org/\">KDE web site</A>. There are\n"
"also useful sites for major applications like\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.konqueror.org/\">Konqueror</A>,\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.koffice.org/\">KOffice</A> and\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.kdevelop.org/\">KDevelop</A>, or important\n"
"KDE utilities like\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://printing.kde.org/\">KDEPrint</A>,\n"
"which can be put to its full usage even outside KDE...\n"
"</P>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/filesystems/desktop.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P>Je tójšto informacije wo KDE na domjacej stronje KDE\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.kde.org/\"></A>. Su tež wužitne serwery za\n"
" hłowne programy kaž\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.konqueror.org/\">Konqueror</A>, \n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.koffice.org/\">KOffice</A> a\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.kdevelop.org/\">KDevelop</A>, abo wažne\n"
"pomocniki kaž\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://printing.kde.org/\">KDEPrint</A>, \n"
"kiž hodźa so samo bjez KDE wužiwać...\n"
"</P>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/filesystems/desktop.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:22
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE is translated into many languages. You can change the country and\n"
"language with the Control Center or in\n"
"K-Menu->Preferences->Personalization->Country & Language.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/locale.png\">\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Andrea Rizzi</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE je so do wjele rěčow přełožiło. Móžeće kraj a rěč w Kontrolnym centrumje\n"
"nastajić abo w K-Meni->Preferency->Personalizacija->Kraj & rěč.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/locale.png\">\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Dodate wot Andree Rizzia</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:35
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can minimize all your windows on the current desktop at once and\n"
"thus reach the desktop itself by clicking on the desktop icon on the\n"
"panel.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/filesystems/desktop.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Móžeće wšitke swoje wokna na aktualnym dźěłowym powjerchu zezačinjeć\n"
"a tak dźěłowy powjerch sam dosahnyć, hdyž na powjerchowy piktogram\n"
"kliknjeće.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/filesystems/desktop.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:46
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you temporarily need more screen real-estate, you can <strong>\"fold\n"
"in\" the panel</strong> by clicking on one of the arrows at the ends of\n"
"the panel. Alternatively, make it hide automatically by changing the\n"
"settings in the Control Center (Desktop->Panels, Hiding tab).\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Trjebaće-li wjace ruma na wobrazowce, móžeće pas skrjebić přez klik na kłok \n"
"na kóncu pasa. Alternatiwnje móžeće jón tak nastajić, zo so awtomatisce chowa\n"
" (Preferency/Napohlad/Pask/Chowanje)</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:56
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"The program Klipper, which is started by default and resides in the\n"
"system tray at the right end of the panel, keeps a number of text\n"
"selections around. These can be retrieved or even (in the case of\n"
"URLs, for example) be executed.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/klipper.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Program Klipper, kiž so normalnje startuje a w systemowym pasku\n"
"na prawym boku pasa chowa, spomjatkuje sej rjad wubranych tekstow.\n"
"Tute hodźa so wuzwolić abo samo (w padźe URLow) wuwjesć.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/klipper.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:68
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"The window list, which is accessible via an icon on the panel, provides a\n"
"quick overview of all windows on all virtual desktops.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/window_list.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Lisćina woknow, kiž je přez piktogram na pasu přistupny, skići spěšny\n"
"přehlad wo wšěch woknach na wšěch wirtuelnych dźěłowych powjerchach.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/window_list.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:78
msgid ""
"<p>The <b>\"Location\" label</b> in Konqueror is draggable.</p>\n"
"<p>This means you can create shortcuts (e.g. on the desktop or the panel)\n"
"by dragging it there with the mouse. You can also drop it on to Konsole or\n"
"edit fields to get the URL typed in there (as you can with links or files\n"
"displayed in Konqueror).</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Etiket \"Městno\"</b> w Konquerorje hodźi so suwać.</p>\n"
"<p> To rěka, zo móžeće skrótšenku (na př. na dźěłowym powjerchu abo w pasu)\n"
"stworić přez to, zo jón tam z myšku sćehnjeće. Móžeće jón tež na Konsolu "
"pušćić\n"
"abo dźěle editować (kaž z wotkazami abo datajemi, kiž so w Konquerorje "
"pokazuja). </p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:87
msgid ""
"<p>For quick access to KDEPrint Manager type\n"
"<strong>\"print:/manager\"</strong>... --  <em>\"Type where?\"</em>,\n"
" you may ask. Type it...</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"  "
"<li>...either in Konqueror's <i>address field</i>,</li>\n"
"  "
"<li>...or in a <i>Run Command</i> dialog,\n"
"         opened by pressing <strong>Alt+F2</strong>.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\">\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Za spěšny přistup k rjadowarjej KDEPrint zapodajće\n"
"<strong>\"print:/manager\"</strong>... -  <em>\"Hdźe mam to zapodać?\"</em>\n"
" so snadź prašeće. Zapodajće je</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li> do adresoweho pola Konquerora<i></i></li>\n"
"<li> abo do dialoga <i> Zapodaj přikaz</i>,\n"
"        <strong>kiž hodźi so z Alt+F2 wočinić.</strong></li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\">\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Dodate wot Kurta Pfeiflea</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:103
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Double-clicking on the titlebar of any window \"shades\" it, which means\n"
"that only the titlebar stays visible. Double-clicking the titlebar a\n"
"second time will make the window visible again."
"<br>\n"
"Of course, you can change this behavior within the Control Center.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Dwójny klik na titlowy pask kóždeho wokna je \"zasćini\", štož rěka,\n"
"zo wostanje jenož titlowy pask widźomny. Druhi dwójny klik na titlowy pask\n"
"cyłe wokno zaso widźomne sčini."
"<br>\n"
"Wězo hodźi so tute zadźerženje w Kontrolnym centrumje změnić.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:113
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can cycle through the windows on a virtual desktop by holding the\n"
"Alt key and pressing Tab or Shift+Tab.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/kcmkwm.png\"></center></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Móžeće wšitke wokna abo dźěłowe powjerchi přeńć, přez to zo dźeržiće Alt-tastu "
"a Tab abo Wulkopisanje+Tab tłóčiće.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/kcmkwm.png\"></center></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:121
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can assign <b>keyboard shortcuts</b> to your favorite applications in the\n"
"KDE menu editor (Right mouse button on K-menu->Menu Editor). Select the "
"application\n"
"(e.g. Konsole), then the tab \"Advanced\" and enter e.g. \"Ctrl+Alt+K\"\n"
"(or use the \"Change\" button).</p>\n"
"<p>That is it: now you can fire up Konsoles with Ctrl+Alt+K.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Móžeće swojim najlubšim programom <b>tastaturowe skrótšenki</b> "
"w KDE-menijowym\n"
" editorje dodać (K-meni-> System -> Menijowy editor). Wubjer program\n"
"(na př. Konsole), potom tabulator \"Dalše opcije\" a zapodajće na př. "
"\"Strg+Alt+K\"\n"
"(abo wužiwajće knefl \"Změnić\").</p>\n"
"<p>To je wšitko! Nětko móžeće Konsole z Strg+Alt+K startować!</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:131
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can configure the number of virtual desktops by adjusting the \"Number\n"
"of desktops\" slider in the Control Center (Desktop->Multiple Desktops).\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Móžeće ličbu dźěłowy powjerchow nastajić z Preferency/Napohlad/\n"
" Dźěłowy powjerch/Ličba dźěłowych powjerchow z K-menija.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:139
msgid ""
"<p>The KDE project was founded in October 1996 and had its first release,\n"
"1.0, on July 12, 1998.</p>\n"
"<p>You can <em>support the KDE project</em> with work (programming, designing,\n"
"documenting, proof-reading, translating, etc.) and financial or\n"
"hardware donations. Please contact <a\n"
" href=\"mailto:kde-ev@kde.org\">kde-ev@kde.org</a>\n"
"if you are interested.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> KDE-projekt je so w oktobrje 1996 załožił a prěnje wudaće, 1.0, je so "
"12-teho julija 1998 do zjawnosće dało.</p>\n"
"<p>Móžeće <em> KDE-projektej pomhać</em>, z dźěłom (programowanjom, "
"designowanjom,\n"
"dokumentowanjom, porjedźowanjom, přełožowanjom, atd.) a z pjenježnymi\n"
"abo wěcnymi darami. Prošu skontaktujće <a\n"
" href=\"mailto:kde-ev@kde.org\">kde-ev@kde.org</a>,\n"
"maće-li zajim.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:150
msgid ""
"<table>"
"<tr>\n"
"<th>Maximize a window</th>\t"
"<th>Click the maximize button</th>\n"
"</tr>"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>full-screen</td>\t\t"
"<td>with the left mouse button</td>\n"
"</tr>"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>vertically only</td>\t"
"<td>with the middle mouse button</td>\n"
"</tr>"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>horizontally only</td>\t"
"<td>with the right mouse button</td>\n"
"</tr></table>\n"
msgstr ""
"<table>"
"<tr>\n"
"<th>Wokno maksimalizować</th>\t"
"<th>Klikńće na knefl maksimalizowanja</th>\n"
"</tr>"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>Cyła wobrazowka</td>\t\t"
"<td>z lěwym myšacym kneflom</td>\n"
"</tr>"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>jenož wertikalnje</td>\t"
"<td>ze srjedźanskim myšacym kneflom</td>\n"
"</tr>"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>jenož horicontalnje</td>\t"
"<td>z prawym myšacym kneflom</td>\n"
"</tr></table>\n"

#: tips.cpp:163
msgid ""
"<p>You can stay up to date with new developments in KDE and releases\n"
"by regularly checking the web site <A\n"
" HREF=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</A>.</p>\n"
"<BR>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Móžeće so wo najnowšich wuwićach w zwisku z KDE na\n"
" <A\n"
" HREF=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</A> wobhonić.</p>\n"
"<BR>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:172
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p align=\"center\"><strong>KDEPrinting (I)</strong></p>\n"
"<p><strong>kprinter</strong>, KDE's new printing utility supports\n"
"different print subsystems. These subsystems differ very much\n"
"in their abilities.</p>\n"
"<p>Among the supported systems are:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>CUPS, the new Common UNIX Printing System;</li>\n"
"<li>LPR/LPD, traditional BSD-style printing;</li>\n"
"<li>RLPR (no need for \"printcap\" editing or root privileges to\n"
"use network printers);</li>\n"
"<li>printing through an external program (generic).</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p align=\"center\"><strong>Ćišćenje z KDE (I)</strong></p>\n"
"<p><strong>Kprinter</strong>, ćišćenski pomocnik w KDE podpěruje\n"
"wšelake ćišćenske systemy. Tute systemy so po swojich móžnosćach\n"
"chětro rozeznawaja.</p>\n"
"<p>Mjez podpěrowanymi systemami su:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>CUPS, nowy ćišćenski system za UNIX;</li>\n"
"<li>LPR/LPD, tradicionalny BSD-ćišćenje;</li>\n"
"<li>RLPR (bjez trěbnosće root-priwilegijow abo konfiguracije w\n"
"\"printcap\", zo by syćowe ćišćaki wužiwał);</li>\n"
"<li>ćišćenje přez eksterne programy.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:188
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p align=\"center\"><strong>KDEPrinting (II)</strong></p>\n"
"<p>Not all print subsystems provide equal abilities\n"
"for KDEPrint to build on.</p>\n"
"<p>The <A HREF=\"http://printing.kde.org/\">KDEPrinting Team</A>\n"
"recommends installing a <A\n"
"HREF=\"http://www.cups.org/\"><strong>CUPS-based</strong></A>\n"
"software as the underlying print subsystem.</p>\n"
"<p> CUPS provides easy usage, powerful features, broad printer\n"
"support and a modern design (based on IPP, the \"Internet\n"
"Printing Protocol\"). Its usefulness is proven for home users\n"
"as well as for large networks.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p align=\"center\"><strong>Ćišćenje z KDE (II)</strong></p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Nic wšitke ćišćenske subsystemy skićeja KDEPrint'ej samsne móžnosće.</p>\n"
"<p><A HREF=\"http://printing.kde.org/\">KDEPrinting Team</A> "
"doporuča instalowanje\n"
"na <A HREF=\"http://www.cups.org/\"><strong>CUPS</strong></A> "
"bazowaceho ćišćenskeho\n"
"subsystema.</p>\n"
"<p>CUPS hodźi so jednorje wužiwać, ma wjele opcijow, podpěruje šěroku paletu "
"ćišćakow\n"
"a je moderny system, bazowacy na IPP (Internet Printing Protocol). CUPS je "
"wužitne za\n"
"wužiwarjow doma runje kaž za wulke syće.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Dodate wot Kurta Pfeiflea</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:205
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE is based on a well-designed C++ foundation. C++ is a programming\n"
"language well suited to desktop development. The KDE object model\n"
"extends the power of C++ even further. See\n"
" <a href=\"http://developer.kde.org/\">http://developer.kde.org/</a>\n"
"for details.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
" KDE bazuje na C++. C++ je programowanska rěč, kiž so za wuwiwanje dźěłowych\n"
"powjerchow derje hodźi. Objektowy model w KDE C++ w tutym nastupanje hišće\n"
"bóle rozšěri. Pohladajće na \n"
"<a href=\"http://developer.kde.org/\">http://developer.kde.org/</a>"
", hdźež nadrobnišo\n"
"wo tym zhoniće.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:216
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can use Konqueror to <strong>browse through tar archives</strong>,\n"
"even compressed ones. You can extract files simply by dragging them\n"
"to another place, e.g. another Konqueror window or the desktop.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Konqueror móžeće wužiwać, zo byšće <strong>tar-archiwy přelistowali</strong>,\n"
"samo hdyž su komprimowane. Dataje so prosće přez to ekstrahuja, zo je na druhe\n"
"městno sćehnjeće, na př. do druheho wokna Konquerora abo na dźěłowy "
"powjerch.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:224
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can cycle through the virtual desktops by holding the Ctrl key and\n"
"pressing Tab or Shift+Tab.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Móžeće z Tab abo Wulkopisanje+Tab wšě wirtuelne dźěłowe powjerchi přeńć,\n"
"dźeržo Strg-tastu stłóčenu.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:231
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>You can start <strong>kprinter</strong> as a standalone program\n"
"from any xterm, Konsole window or from the \"Run Command\" dialog (started\n"
"by pressing <i>Alt+F2</i>). Then select the file to print. You can print\n"
"as many items of different types as you want, all at once.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\"></center>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Móžeće <strong>kprinter</strong> jako samostatny program\n"
"z xterm, Konsole abo komandoweje linki (kotruž z <i>Alt+F2</i> "
"dóstanjeće) startować.\n"
"Potom wubjerjeće dataju, kiž chceće wućišćeć. Móžeće naraz tež wjacore dataje "
"wubrać.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer2.png\"></center>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Dodate wot Kurta Pfeiflea</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:243
msgid ""
"<p>You may at any time switch <strong>kprinter</strong> to another\n"
"print subsystem \"on the fly\" (and you don't need to be root to do it.)\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Laptop users who frequently change to different environments may find\n"
"<A HREF=\"ftp://truffula.com/pub/\">RLPR</A> a useful complement to CUPS\n"
"(or any other print subsystem they use as their preferred one).\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:255
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<P>\n"
"KDE's help system can display not only KDE's own HTML-based help, but\n"
"also info and man pages.</P>"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/khelpcenter.png\"></center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P> s KDE s</P>"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/khelpcenter.png\"></center>"

#: tips.cpp:263
msgid ""
"<P>Clicking with the right mouse button on panel icons or applets opens a\n"
"popup menu that allows you to move or remove the item, or add a new one.</P>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:269
msgid ""
"<P>If a toolbar is not large enough to display all buttons on it, you can\n"
"click on the small arrow at the far right end of the toolbar to see\n"
"the remaining buttons.</P>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:276
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Need comprehensive info about KDEPrinting?"
"<br> </p>\n"
"<p> Type <strong>help:/kdeprint/</strong> into a Konqueror address field\n"
"and get the\n"
" <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/documentation/handbook/\">"
"KDEPrint Handbook</a>\n"
"displayed.</p> "
"<p>This, plus more material (like a\n"
